}

{
  "presses": ["R-pinky-top", "R-index-home-in", "R-index-bottom-in", "L-pinky-top"],
  "locks": { "R-pinky-top": "Z" },
  "note": "t6: presses {L-pinky-home,R-index-home-in,R-index-bottom-in,R-pinky-top(Z)} -> {H,L,O,Z}. Since R-pinky-top not in rotation list, R-pinky-top=Z fixed. Thus {A=L-pinky-home,B=R-index-home-in,C=R-index-bottom-in}={H,L,O} with A∈{L,O}; so exactly one of {B,C} is H. Rotation after t6: {L-pinky-bottom,L-pinky-top} rotated (swap among them). Plan t7 chord replace A with L-pinky-top to pinpoint which of {B,C} is H."
}

{
